This repository provides a downstream SuperMimic implementation for UniLab.
UniLab and UniSim are separate upstream projects licensed under Apache-2.0.

The implementation was developed with reference to the SuperMimic reference
code in supermimic_vibed, whose MIT license and original copyright notice are
preserved in LICENSES/MIT-supermimic.txt. The BONES-SEED data pipeline was
adapted from SuperMimic-Reproduced; its MIT license and copyright notice are
preserved in LICENSES/MIT-supermimic-reproduced.txt.

The experimental Go2 velocity task includes reward/feet mathematics adapted
from enffft/supermimic, Copyright (c) 2026 Yuxi Liu, under the MIT license.
The original notice and frozen source hashes are in migration/source_reference.

SuperMimic paper:
"SuperMimic: Scaling Humanoid Whole-Body Control with One Differentiable
World Model", Qiayuan Liao et al., https://supermimic.github.io
